# Force LF everywhere. constitution.checksum() hashes raw bytes of
# constitution/__init__.py and core/portfolio.py; every real promotion and
# every scheduled run happens in a Linux cloud container that writes LF, so
# that's what evotrader.manifest was sealed against. Without this file, a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materializes those same two
# files with CRLF and constitution.verify() reports CONSTITUTION MODIFIED
# for a difference that is pure whitespace, not content — found 2026-09-08
# while starting the short-selling implementation (12 tests in
# tests/test_run_from_files_matches_bundle.py failed on exactly this before
# any real edit was made). Does not affect evotrader_bundle.py's own live
# path: EMBEDDED_SOURCES entries are single-line string literals with
# escaped \n sequences, immune to checkout line-ending conversion.
* text=auto eol=lf
